  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "osm-polygon-wikidata-sentence-relevance",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOSM Polygon \u2013 Wikidata Sentence Relevance\n\t\n\nThis dataset contains sentence-level, model-generated relevance annotations for\nOSM polygons joined to Wikipedia and Wikivoyage sections. The labels are not\nground truth; validate them before use.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tPublic release map\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nRelease\nContents\nCard\nDashboard\n\n\n\t\t\nV1 Afghanistan\n54,462 two-question annotations, 161 polygons, 115 languages\nv1-afghanistan/ \u00b7 card\nAfghanistan Trackio\n\n\nV2 worldwide\n200,000 H3-stratified binary\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/NoeFlandre/osm-polygon-wikidata-sentence-relevance.",
  "alternateName": [
    "NoeFlandre/osm-polygon-wikidata-sentence-relevance",
    "OSM Polygon \u2013 Wikidata Sentence Relevance"
  ],
